-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Witness construction in proof of Proposition 3.3.1(i)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>164</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement and witness proof compared in supplied OCR; local function-set formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-2.3.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；满足输入的变量顺序是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1},v_n\">\\(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1},v_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有限元组满足记号取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=v_n\">\\(y=v_n\\)</span>, using the variable sequence from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1},y\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1},y\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (parameter satisfaction induced by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Skolem}_{\\mathfrak{A},n}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Skolem}_{\\mathfrak{A},n}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (set defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Skolem}_{\\mathfrak{A},n}(\\varphi)\n=\\bigl\\{f:|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\to|\\mathfrak{A}|:\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;&amp;\n\\bigl[\n(\\exists b\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi[\\bar a\\frown\\langle b\\rangle])\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi[\\bar a\\frown\\langle f(\\bar a)\\rangle]\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Skolem}_{\\mathfrak{A},n}(\\varphi)\n=\\bigl\\{f:|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\to|\\mathfrak{A}|:\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;&amp;\n\\bigl[\n(\\exists b\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi[\\bar a\\frown\\langle b\\rangle])\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi[\\bar a\\frown\\langle f(\\bar a)\\rangle]\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A member of this set chooses a witness whenever one exists; its value is\nunconstrained at tuples for which the existential formula is false. The index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> fixes both the function domain and the distinguished witness variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=v_n\">\\(y=v_n\\)</span>.  Parameter\nsatisfaction abbreviates the corresponding assignment-based relation from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","